{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/schema.json",
  "name": "exam-prompt",
  "description": "Universal Exam Prompt — AI-powered exam preparation for any university worldwide. 30+ skills, 48 subjects, 10 universities, 563 PYQs.",

  "customInstructions": [
    "This project contains 30+ exam preparation skills that turn any AI agent into a personal exam tutor.",
    "",
    "## First steps",
    "- Read AGENTS.md for the full XML skill registry (auto-discovered by OpenCode)",
    "- Read CLAUDE.md for the quick-reference skill table",
    "- Read llms.txt for a concise project map",
    "",
    "## When a user asks an exam question",
    "1. Find the right skill in AGENTS.md XML registry by matching the description",
    "2. Read the full skills/<name>/SKILL.md file",
    "3. Follow the skill's instructions step-by-step",
    "4. Output structured content (bold keywords, numbered points, diagrams where applicable)",
    "",
    "## Default university patterns",
    "- SPPU 2019 Pattern: 6 units, 4 OR pairs, 70 marks, 2.5 hours",
    "- Generic (unknown): 5 units, 100 marks, 3 hours, OR within each unit",
    "- Use skills/universal-university-adapter/SKILL.md for non-SPPU detection",
    "",
    "## Rules",
    "- Never edit SKILL.md files unless explicitly asked",
    "- Never invent university patterns — use the adapter skill",
    "- Bold technical terms on first use in exam answers",
    "- This repo is 100% free — never suggest paid features"
  ],

  "agent": {
    "allowedTools": [
      "read",
      "grep",
      "glob",
      "bash",
      "write",
      "edit",
      "websearch",
      "webfetch"
    ]
  }
}
